---
Implement flanger effect (short modulated delay with feedback).

Like chorus but shorter delay times (0.1-10ms) and feedback
creates the metallic "jet engine" sweep.

## Parameters
- rate: LFO speed (0.05-5 Hz, default 0.3)
- depth: Modulation depth in ms (0-5ms, default 2.0)
- feedback: Feedback amount (-0.95 to 0.95, default 0.5)
- wet: Wet/dry mix (0-1, default 0.5)

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] EFFECT_FLANGER added to effect type enum
- [ ] Metallic sweep audible
- [ ] Negative feedback inverts comb pattern
- [ ] No instability at max feedback

## Test Plan
- [ ] Verify flanging on drum loop
- [ ] Positive vs negative feedback sound different
